# 语言统计：signing/ 里是 Inno Setup 的二进制工具链（32 MB），体积占比会把
# GitHub 的仓库语言误判成 Inno Setup。这里显式排除，让统计回归到 C#。
signing/InnoSetup6-patched/** linguist-vendored
signing/InnoSetup6-patched/** linguist-detectable=false
signing/toolchain/** linguist-detectable=false
assets/tools/** linguist-vendored
assets/tools/** linguist-detectable=false
src/LanShare.Server/wwwroot/vendor/** linguist-vendored
src/LanShare.Server/wwwroot/vendor/** linguist-detectable=false

# 行尾：Windows 项目统一 CRLF，避免跨平台 diff 噪音
* text=auto
*.cs text
*.xaml text
*.csproj text
*.ps1 text
*.md text
*.iss text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.7z binary
*.lib binary
*.obj binary
*.exp binary
